inted, "english": an English name, optional}. Reply with JSON only: {"dishes":[{"name":string,"confident":boolean,"ingredients":[{"name":string,"level":"essential"|"common"|"possible"}],"ratings":[{"allergen":string (one of the ids above),"rating":"usually"|"often"|"rarely"|"unknown","why":string}]}]}. Copy "name" exactly as given. Set confident to false if you do not know the dish.

